{"id":"gegenu_ber","lemma":"gegenüber","pos":"prep","rank":828,"glosses":["opposite","to, toward, towards","compared to"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3a/De-at-gegen%C3%BCber.ogg/De-at-gegen%C3%BCber.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Das neue Büro ist gegenüber.","en":"The new office is across the street.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"new","l":"neu"},{"g":"office"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Sie wohnt gegenüber von uns.","en":"She lives just across from us.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to live, reside, dwell","l":"wohnen"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"}]},{"text":"Du musst ehrlich mir gegenüber sein.","en":"You need to be honest with me.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"honest, truthful, true"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Der Wagen steht gegenüber dem Gebäude.","en":"The car's parked opposite that building.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"a car"},{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},null,{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"building"}]},{"text":"Sie wohnen im Haus gegenüber von uns.","en":"They live in the house opposite to ours.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/787713","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to live, reside, dwell"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"house, building"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"}]}]}